# The bicycle's default gear, ridden west out of Jubilife City.
#
# The tile is the one the game's own spawn table flies to, the same as the
# jubilife station's, so nothing here is a guessed coordinate. West is the
# direction with a clear run: the port's map scan says north is a door, and a
# door is a collision that warps, so riding into one ends the station on the
# wrong map; which is what the first version of this did.
#
# 72 held frames carry the default gear 12 tiles and the other gear 17, which
# is the pair of numbers this station and bike-gear2 exist to hold apart.

name RIDER
gender GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 30006
money 3000
badge BADGE_ID_COAL
party SPECIES_BIBAREL 30 ITEM_NONE
item ITEM_BICYCLE 1
register-item ITEM_BICYCLE
map MAP_HEADER_JUBILIFE_CITY 0xB4 0x309 FACE_LEFT
